msgstr "CD čupač"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: kaudiocreator.appdata.xml:9
msgid "KAudioCreator is an audio CD ripper, which uses \"cdparanoia\" as a backend to extract the tracks and later it encodes them to mp3 or ogg files (or many other formats supported)"
msgstr "KAudioCreator je  audio CD ekstraktor, koji koristi \"cdparanoia\" kao pozadinu za vađenje traka i kasnije ih kodira u  mp3 ili ogg datoteke (ili mnoge druge podržane formate)"

